      "current_tex": "\\begin{corollary}[Rational and Irrational Points in Every Open Interval]\n\\label{cor:every-open-interval-contains-rational-and-irrational}\nFor every $a,b\\in\\mathbb{R}$ with $a<b$, there exist\n$q\\in\\mathbb{Q}$ and $s\\in\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\mathbb{Q}$ such that\n\\[\n  a<q<b\n  \\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n  a<s<b.\n\\]\n\\hyperref[prf:every-open-interval-contains-rational-and-irrational]{Go to proof.}\n\\end{corollary}",
